# Rust build output. Cargo.lock is deliberately *not* here: it is committed, which is
# what makes a dependency update a thing that happened on a date (docs/UPDATING.md).
/target

# OS
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.local

# Claude Code per-machine settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# The measured-run sentinel (docs/FULL-RUN.md). It describes one night's procedure state —
# which step was reached, what has already been established — so it is per-machine and
# transient by nature. CLAUDE.md's first rule keys on its presence.
/RUN-STATE.json
